guide polestar-completionist-alliance/unplaced-quests
title Quests the data cannot place (Completionist)
faction Alliance
category Miscellaneous
levels 1-60
zone Stormwind City
pitch A checklist: the quests Polestar's reference data names but cannot lead to.

step About this guide
  note The reference data has no giver, hand-in, level or zone for these quests, so no guide can lead to them. Each is listed by its title for you to find and tick off. Some may not be in the game.

step Hillsbrad Foothills
  task "Your First Horse, level 40" optional -- quest 99326

step Wetlands
  task "Your First Horse, level 40" optional -- quest 98166

step No zone in the data
  task "Camping 101: Engineering, level 6" optional -- quest 98287
  task "Confounding Flash, level 10" optional -- quest 94825
  task "Confounding Flash, level 10" optional -- quest 94826
  task "Message from the Supreme Magister, level 35" optional -- quest 98471
  task "A Ticking Present, level 40" optional -- quest 79637
  task "Krol'dok No More!, level 42" optional -- quest 94969
